doc:action_award_2012_05_03 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "on 3 May 2012, the Fund approved the award of Viva TV-Radio Viva to company A. for the price of USD 5,000,000."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2012-05-03"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_award_2012_05_03_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "Following the notification of the outcome of the tendering process to the Radio and Television Supreme Council and the Competition Authority, on 3 May 2012, the Fund approved the award of Viva TV-Radio Viva to company A. for the price of USD 5,000,000."@en .

doc:action_consolidate_radio_viva_2007_07_19 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "the seized assets, rights, properties and associated components utilised by Radio Viva ... would also be consolidated into a single economic and commercial unit."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2007-07-19"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:partAdminactionConsolidateVivaTvFund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "A similar resolution was adopted regarding Radio Viva. The Fund decided that the seized assets, rights, properties and associated components utilised by Radio Viva, including contracts and the rights arising therefrom, would also be consolidated into a single economic and commercial unit."@en .

doc:action_consolidate_viva_tv_2007_07_19 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "With respect to Viva TV, the Fund resolved to consolidate all seized assets, rights, properties and associated components ... into a single economic and commercial unit."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2007-07-19"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:partAdminactionConsolidateVivaTvFund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "With respect to Viva TV, the Fund resolved to consolidate all seized assets, rights, properties and associated components, such as contracts and the rights arising therefrom, belonging to debtor companies within the Erol Aksoy Group and effectively used by Viva TV into a single economic and commercial unit."@en .

doc:action_continue_tender_2011_02_10 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "10 February 2011 the Fund decided to continue the tendering process through negotiation."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2011-02-10"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_continue_tender_2011_02_10_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "As this bid was below the estimated value, 10 February 2011 the Fund decided to continue the tendering process through negotiation."@en .

doc:action_establish_units_2007_07_19 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "the Fund decided to establish two economic and commercial units: one for Viva TV and the other for Radio Viva."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2007-07-19"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_2007_07_19_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 19 July 2007, the Fund decided to establish two economic and commercial units: one for Viva TV and the other for Radio Viva."@en .

doc:action_merge_2009_07_09 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "the Fund decided to merge the two economic and commercial units, thereby creating the Viva TV-Radio Viva Economic and Commercial Unit"@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2009-07-09"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_2007_07_19_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 9 July 2009, the Fund decided to merge the two economic and commercial units, thereby creating the Viva TV-Radio Viva Economic and Commercial Unit (hereinafter referred to as “Viva TV-Radio Viva”)."@en .

doc:action_offer_sale_2007_08_29 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "the Fund resolved to offer both Viva TV and Radio Viva for sale together in a single tendering process"@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2007-08-29"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_offer_sale_2007_08_29_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 29 August 2007, the Fund resolved to offer both Viva TV and Radio Viva for sale together in a single tendering process, setting a reserve price of USD 8,000,000."@en .

doc:action_offer_sale_2009_11_05 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "the Fund resolved to offer Viva TV-Radio Viva for sale, establishing a reserve price of USD 6,000,000."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2009-11-05"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_offer_sale_2007_08_29_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 5 November 2009, the Fund resolved to offer Viva TV-Radio Viva for sale, establishing a reserve price of USD 6,000,000."@en .

doc:action_offer_sale_2011_01_13 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "On 13 January 2011, the Fund decided to offer Viva TV-Radio Viva for sale again, setting the reserve price at USD 6,000,000."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2011-01-13"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_offer_sale_2007_08_29_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 13 January 2011, the Fund decided to offer Viva TV-Radio Viva for sale again, setting the reserve price at USD 6,000,000."@en .

doc:action_transfer_2012_05_09 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "On 9 May 2012, company A. deposited the tender amount into the Fund’s bank account. On the same day, the parties signed the “Agreement on Takeover of Viva TV-Radio Viva” and the Fund transferred the ownership of Viva TV-Radio Viva to company A."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:fund ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2012-05-09"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_award_2012_05_03_fund ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 9 May 2012, company A. deposited the tender amount into the Fund’s bank account. On the same day, the parties signed the “Agreement on Takeover of Viva TV-Radio Viva” and the Fund transferred the ownership of Viva TV-Radio Viva to company A."@en .

doc:action_tskb_report_2007_08_01 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "TSKB issued a report and determined that the value of the Radio Viva Economic and Commercial Unit was 4,258,000 USD and Viva TV was 373,400 USD."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:tskb ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2007-08-01"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_tskb_2007_08_01 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 1 August 2007, the Industrial Development Bank of Türkiye ( Türkiye Sınaî Kalkınma Bankası A.Ş ., hereinafter referred to as “TSKB”) issued a report and determined that the value of the Radio Viva Economic and Commercial Unit (hereinafter referred to as “Radio Viva”) was 4,258,000 United States dollars (USD), while the value of the Viva TV Economic and Commercial Unit (hereinafter referred to as “Viva TV”) was USD 373,400."@en .

doc:action_tskb_valuation_2009_06_30 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "a valuation report issued by TSKB determined that the value of Radio Viva was USD 5,782,000 and Viva TV was USD 132,000."@en ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:tskb ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2009-06-30"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:part_adminaction_tskb_2007_08_01 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 30 June 2009, a valuation report issued by TSKB determined that the value of Radio Viva was USD 5,782,000 and the value of Viva TV was USD 132,000."@en .

