doc:event_board_transfer_2001_03_15 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "Board decision to transfer management and control of İktisat Bank to the Fund"@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:event_state_of_crisis_2001_02_19 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2001-03-15"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_board_event_board_transfer_2001_03_15,
        doc:participation_fund_event_board_transfer_2001_03_15,
        doc:participation_iktisat_bank_event_board_transfer_2001_03_15 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "By a decision dated 15 March 2001, the Banking Regulation and Supervision Board ( Bankalar Düzenleme ve Denetleme Kurulu , hereinafter “the Board”) resolved to transfer the management and control of İktisat Bankası T.A.Ş. (hereinafter “İktisat Bank” or “the Bank”) to the Savings Deposit Insurance Fund ( Tasarruf Mevduat Sigorta Fonu , hereinafter “the Fund”), pursuant to section 14(3) of the Banking Activities Act (Law no. 4389)."@en .

doc:event_fund_default_actions_2008_04_03 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "Fund concluded default and resolved to initiate legal proceedings and sale of assets"@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:event_liquidation_protocol_2006_05_09 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2008-04-03"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_erol_aksoy_group_event_fund_default_actions_2008_04_03,
        doc:participation_fund_event_fund_default_actions_2008_04_03 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 3 April 2008, the Fund concluded that the Erol Aksoy Group had failed to fulfil several commitments and obligations set out in the Liquidation Protocol, rendering the Protocol no longer effective for the recovery of public receivables. Consequently, the Fund decided to rely on its provisions concerning default. It resolved to initiate legal proceedings against all natural and legal person debtors within the Erol Aksoy Group and to proceed with the sale of assets, including those consolidated as an economic and commercial unit."@en .

doc:event_fund_recover_2001_09_14 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "Fund resolved to recover debts from former shareholders"@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:event_board_transfer_2001_03_15 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2001-09-14"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_avrupa_holding_event_fund_recover_2001_09_14,
        doc:participation_erol_aksoy_event_fund_recover_2001_09_14,
        doc:participation_fund_event_fund_recover_2001_09_14 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "As a result, on 14 September 2001, the Fund resolved to recover 726,122,000 Turkish liras from the former shareholders by taking all necessary measures, including relying on the provisions of Law no. 6183 on the Collection of Debts Due to the State and imposing injunctions."@en .

doc:event_liquidation_protocol_2006_05_09 a echr:AdministrativeAction ;
    rdfs:label "Debt Liquidation Protocol signed between the Fund and the Erol Aksoy Group"@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:event_fund_recover_2001_09_14 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2006-05-09"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_erol_aksoy_group_event_liquidation_protocol_2006_05_09,
        doc:participation_erol_aksoy_personal_event_liquidation_protocol_2006_05_09,
        doc:participation_fund_event_liquidation_protocol_2006_05_09 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 9 May 2006, a debt liquidation protocol ( Borç Tasfiye Protokolü , hereinafter referred to as “the Liquidation Protocol”) was signed between the Fund (as creditor) and the Erol Aksoy Group (as debtor). The applicant personally signed the Liquidation Protocol as one of the debtors."@en .

